   220	    - Use the median-offset segment as the reference extent, but erase that lane from the output entirely.
   221	    - Rank all segments by input length to determine canonical rank colors, then rank only the non-reference segments by the same input lengths and place them onto the visible lanes from low offset to high offset.
   222	    - Every visible output segment is drawn at the reference start and reference length; isolated pixels remain unchanged.
